# Reports / certificates / dossier

- Visual source of truth: [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) + live `portal.html`
- Shared web skin: `css/reganchor-report.css` (link after `reganchor.css`)
- Production PDF path: app/portal → edge → Puppeteer → template HTML — **not** `generate-pdf.html` (orphaned jsPDF)
- Org governance dossier: `dossier-template.html` + `POST /render-dossier` + `generate-dossier` edge
- Web and PDF need not be pixel-identical; they must feel like the same product
- After CSS/JS changes on `file://`, tell the user to hard-refresh
- Do not claim “restyled” unless Findings domain tabs and Roadmap actions look like quiet ledgers (no all-red headers, no pink number bars)

## Checklist

- Domain header: ink title + Blurple meter + risk on status only
- Roadmap: compact numbered rows, muted owners, no phase-coloured slabs
- No Instrument Serif / DM Sans / dark navy canvas leftovers
- Sentence case labels throughout
- Dossier: current RegAnchor / RA mark (not retired icon); no fake data when tables are empty
- Dossier fonts: **Inter only** (app UI face). No Source Serif / Instrument / display serif experiments
- Customer-facing inventory term: **AI assets** (table may still be `ai_systems`)
- Do not surface asset kind / type in the dossier (removed from product; inventory is assets only)
- Controls section must separate **status** vs **suggested evidence** vs **uploaded evidence**; do not invent article↔control links that are not in Supabase
- **Forbidden:** Anchor Line (hairline + blurple/gradient blob at 61.8%). Plain 1px `--line` only.